Overlay patch 0016: fix SpaghettiGui.cpp's mobile include path.
Under __IOS__/__ANDROID__ upstream includes "port/mobile/MobileImpl.h", but
this LUS exports the header at include/ship/port/mobile/MobileImpl.h — the
path is one segment short (written against a different LUS layout; first
compile ever taken down this branch, most likely). No call sites in the
file today, so the corrected include is inert but faithful to upstream
intent. Upstreamable one-liner.

--- a/src/port/SpaghettiGui.cpp
+++ b/src/port/SpaghettiGui.cpp
@@ -17,7 +17,7 @@
 #endif
 
 #if defined(__ANDROID__) || defined(__IOS__)
-#include "port/mobile/MobileImpl.h"
+#include "ship/port/mobile/MobileImpl.h"
 #endif
 
 #ifdef ENABLE_OPENGL
